data: {"type":"data-vendo-build-failed","data":{"toolCallId":"hcall_5_1c43b28c-13e0-4b5a-b98c-7542a34248ac","reason":"app build failed: This app wasn't created, because it didn't pass the checks that keep an app honest: The entire balance display section was not built — it renders the literal placeholder text 'This section could not be built — retry the edit' instead of any data; the checking account balance (941220 cents from accounts.data[0].balance), the threshold comparison, the deficit card, and the MapleSparkline must all be bound to real query data and rendered here. The balance is 941220 (cents), which is $9,412.20 — well above $2,000 — but the app never renders any balance value at all, so the user sees no current balance despite the app's core promise; bind and display accounts.data[0].balance (converting cents to dollars) prominently. The conditional notification card (shown when balance < $2,000) and the calm confirmation card (shown when balance >= $2,000) are both completely absent; the app must render one of these two cards based on the actual balance value from the query."}}

